Date: Wed, 15 Dec 1993 10:50:23 -0800
From: dkrieger@netcom.com (Dave Krieger)
Subject: VVLS: Extropian story from Village Voice Literary Supplement

>The millenium wasn't supposed to go out like this.  From the first
